   "source": [
    "# Quiz: Defining Data Science\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Why is the word <em>Science</em> in Data Science?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>It uses scientific methods to analyze data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Data science uses scientific methods, such as probability and statistics.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Only people with academic degrees can understand it</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The word \"Science\" refers to the scientific methods data science uses, not to who can understand it.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>To make is sound cool</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Data science really does use scientific methods, such as probability and statistics.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Learning Data Science is only useful for developers</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>True</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Data science is applied in many areas, such as finance, medicine and marketing.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>False</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Data science is applied in many areas, such as finance, medicine and marketing.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What do we need to demonstrate that basketball players are taller than average people?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Collect some data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. You need data, but you also need statistics to test the claim.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Know some probability and statistics</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. You need statistics, but first you need data to work with.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>All of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. First you collect data, then you use statistics to test the claim.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which areas are closely related to data science?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Artificial Intelligence</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. AI is a related field, but so is machine learning.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Machine Learning</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Machine learning is a related field, but so is AI.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>All of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Machine learning and AI are both fields related to data science.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which of the following is an example of non-structured data?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>List of students in class</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. A list of students is like a table, so it is structured data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Collection of student essays</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Text, like a set of essays, is unstructured data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Graph of friends of social network users</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Social network graphs are semi-structured data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-01-post-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is the main goal of data science?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>to collect data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Collecting data is just the first step. The goal is to make decisions based on data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>to process data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Processing is one step along the way. The goal is to make decisions based on data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>to be able to make decisions based on data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The ultimate goal of data science is to make decisions based on data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  }
